ntic judgment, not deterministic data reshaping.\",\"domain_coverage\":\"uncovered\",\"domain_label\":\"contract-risk-analysis\"},{\"document_id\":\":behavioral-subtree:#uuid \\\"9880798a-8487-3a24-93e4-b59c5ae5d789\\\"\",\"reasoning\":\"This behavioral subtree is for renaming or moving code symbols. It is entirely irrelevant to legal contract review.\",\"fitness_score\":0.0,\"domain_reasoning\":\"No overlap with legal or document analysis.\",\"domain_coverage\":\"uncovered\",\"domain_label\":\"contract-risk-analysis\"},{\"document_id\":\":behavioral-subtree:#uuid \\\"b638e3fa-50c0-3fb8-b306-11d067550afe\\\"\",\"reasoning\":\"This behavior is for coordinated code edits involving dependency manifests. It is entirely irrelevant to the intent.\",\"fitness_score\":0.0,\"domain_reasoning\":\"No overlap with legal or document analysis.\",\"domain_coverage\":\"uncovered\",\"domain_label\":\"contract-risk-analysis\"},{\"document_id\":\":behavioral-subtree:#uuid \\\"225be622-6cc2-3359-8c18-024bdf08548d\\\"\",\"reasoning\":\"This is a specialized form of Investigation for code bugs. It has no applicability to legal risk flagging.\",\"fitness_score\":0.0,\"domain_reasoning\":\"No overlap with legal or document analysis.\",\"domain_coverage\":\"uncovered\",\"domain_label\":\"contract-risk-analysis\"}]",
